{"id":"vol8-01","section":3,"path":"bank/listening/vol8-01/audio-3.m4a","model":"small","duration":408.76,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":5.44,"text":"Part 3 You will hear a business student called Ron getting","words":[["Part",0.0,0.28],["3",0.28,0.72],["You",0.72,2.02],["will",2.02,2.16],["hear",2.16,2.48],["a",2.48,2.78],["business",2.78,3.04],["student",3.04,3.7],["called",3.7,4.12],["Ron",4.12,4.52],["getting",4.52,5.44]]},{"start":5.44,"end":12.98,"text":"feedback from his tutor on his presentation. First, you have some time to look at questions","words":[["feedback",5.44,6.02],["from",6.02,6.38],["his",6.38,6.62],["tutor",6.62,6.92],["on",6.92,7.64],["his",7.64,7.82],["presentation.",7.82,8.58],["First,",9.6,10.12],["you",11.08,11.28],["have",11.28,11.48],["some",11.48,11.68],["time",11.68,12.1],["to",12.1,12.36],["look",12.36,12.5],["at",12.5,12.68],["questions",12.68,12.98]]},{"start":12.98,"end":50.93,"text":"21 to 24. Now listen carefully and answer questions 21 to 24.","words":[["21",12.98,13.94],["to",13.94,14.52],["24.",14.52,15.26],["Now",45.79,46.17],["listen",46.17,46.51],["carefully",46.51,47.01],["and",47.01,48.01],["answer",48.01,48.35],["questions",48.35,48.75],["21",48.75,49.67],["to",49.67,50.21],["24.",50.21,50.93]]},{"start":54.36,"end":62.56,"text":"Thanks Ron for coming to my office to discuss the presentation you gave yesterday to the","words":[["Thanks",54.36,54.9],["Ron",54.9,55.22],["for",55.22,55.46],["coming",55.46,55.76],["to",55.76,55.96],["my",55.96,56.12],["office",56.12,56.46],["to",56.46,56.72],["discuss",56.72,57.0],["the",57.0,57.24],["presentation",57.24,57.66],["you",57.66,58.18],["gave",58.18,58.38],["yesterday",58.38,58.92],["to",58.92,62.08],["the",62.08,62.56]]},{"start":62.56,"end":67.52,"text":"What you did with the aim of helping you improve your next presentation? Sounds good","words":[["What",62.56,62.82],["you",62.82,63.08],["did",63.08,63.36],["with",63.36,63.74],["the",63.74,63.94],["aim",63.94,64.3],["of",64.3,64.5],["helping",64.5,64.8],["you",64.8,64.96],["improve",64.96,65.32],["your",65.32,65.68],["next",65.68,65.96],["presentation?",65.96,66.56],["Sounds",67.0,67.28],["good",67.28,67.52]]},{"start":68.26,"end":72.8,"text":"Now the topic was the just-in-time or JIT","words":[["Now",68.26,68.86],["the",68.86,69.18],["topic",69.18,69.64],["was",69.64,70.04],["the",70.04,70.3],["just",70.3,70.62],["-in",70.62,70.84],["-time",70.84,71.22],["or",71.22,71.74],["JIT",71.74,72.8]]},{"start":72.8,"end":79.7,"text":"Supply system used by a lot of manufacturers first in Japan and then in the West I think yes","words":[["Supply",72.8,73.5],["system",73.5,73.94],["used",73.94,74.48],["by",74.48,74.72],["a",74.72,74.8],["lot",74.8,74.94],["of",74.94,75.04],["manufacturers",75.04,75.68],["first",75.68,76.36],["in",76.36,76.72],["Japan",76.72,77.1],["and",77.1,77.86],["then",77.86,78.14],["in",78.14,78.28],["the",78.28,78.38],["West",78.38,78.62],["I",78.62,78.86],["think",78.86,78.98],["yes",78.98,79.7]]},{"start":79.7,"end":87.74,"text":"But actually one thing I should have made clearer and talked about was the fact that the Americans actually pioneered the idea of","words":[["But",79.7,80.44],["actually",80.44,81.06],["one",81.06,81.32],["thing",81.32,81.56],["I",81.56,81.82],["should",81.82,82.02],["have",82.02,82.14],["made",82.14,82.36],["clearer",82.36,82.86],["and",82.86,83.36],["talked",83.36,83.58],["about",83.58,83.88],["was",83.88,84.44],["the",84.44,84.56],["fact",84.56,84.86],["that",84.86,85.2],["the",85.2,85.42],["Americans",85.42,85.9],["actually",85.9,86.48],["pioneered",86.48,87.0],["the",87.0,87.14],["idea",87.14,87.54],["of",87.54,87.74]]},{"start":87.74,"end":90.2,"text":"Just-in-time though it wasn't called that","words":[["Just",87.74,87.98],["-in",87.98,88.2],["-time",88.2,88.5],["though",88.5,89.18],["it",89.18,89.36],["wasn't",89.36,89.62],["called",89.62,89.88],["that",89.88,90.2]]},{"start":90.2,"end":96.18,"text":"Henry Ford and his cars in fact at the turn of the 20th century and later a big","words":[["Henry",90.2,91.22],["Ford",91.22,91.56],["and",91.56,91.8],["his",91.8,91.9],["cars",91.9,92.24],["in",92.24,92.54],["fact",92.54,92.84],["at",92.84,93.08],["the",93.08,93.18],["turn",93.18,93.42],["of",93.42,93.52],["the",93.52,93.62],["20th",93.62,94.08],["century",94.08,94.36],["and",94.36,95.4],["later",95.4,95.64],["a",95.64,96.06],["big",96.06,96.18]]},{"start":96.18,"end":101.46,"text":"U.S. supermarket chain used it and this was where Toyota in Japan got the idea","words":[["U",96.18,96.46],[".S.",96.46,96.68],["supermarket",96.7,96.98],["chain",96.98,97.48],["used",97.48,97.8],["it",97.8,98.0],["and",98.0,98.44],["this",98.44,98.7],["was",98.7,98.9],["where",98.9,99.14],["Toyota",99.14,99.46],["in",99.46,99.94],["Japan",99.94,100.32],["got",100.32,100.94],["the",100.94,101.1],["idea",101.1,101.46]]},{"start":101.46,"end":106.78,"text":"for its car making. Yes that would have been a good addition. Now before we go","words":[["for",101.46,101.74],["its",101.74,101.88],["car",101.88,102.06],["making.",102.06,102.32],["Yes",102.76,103.32],["that",103.32,103.72],["would",103.72,103.88],["have",103.88,104.04],["been",104.04,104.16],["a",104.16,104.24],["good",104.24,104.36],["addition.",104.36,104.74],["Now",105.6,106.16],["before",106.16,106.48],["we",106.48,106.64],["go",106.64,106.78]]},{"start":106.78,"end":111.18,"text":"any further I think I would suggest that you should have stopped and clearly","words":[["any",106.78,106.96],["further",106.96,107.4],["I",107.4,107.92],["think",107.92,108.26],["I",108.26,108.48],["would",108.48,108.6],["suggest",108.6,108.96],["that",108.96,109.28],["you",109.28,109.46],["should",109.46,109.7],["have",109.7,109.86],["stopped",109.86,110.32],["and",110.32,110.74],["clearly",110.74,111.18]]},{"start":111.18,"end":116.28,"text":"defined just in time for your seminar colleagues. You said its aim was to","words":[["defined",111.18,111.86],["just",111.86,112.36],["in",112.36,112.6],["time",112.6,112.9],["for",112.9,113.12],["your",113.12,113.24],["seminar",113.24,113.5],["colleagues.",113.5,114.0],["You",114.68,115.0],["said",115.0,115.28],["its",115.28,115.54],["aim",115.54,115.9],["was",115.9,116.12],["to",116.12,116.28]]},{"start":116.28,"end":122.7,"text":"reduce waste, and you mentioned that classic business theory assumes that stock or inventory","words":[["reduce",116.28,116.62],["waste,",116.62,117.02],["and",117.38,117.54],["you",117.54,117.76],["mentioned",117.76,118.26],["that",118.26,118.78],["classic",118.78,119.3],["business",119.3,119.7],["theory",119.7,120.18],["assumes",120.18,120.72],["that",120.72,120.98],["stock",120.98,121.52],["or",121.52,122.22],["inventory",122.22,122.7]]},{"start":122.7,"end":129.52,"text":"of parts are counted as assets, but just in time sees them as unnecessary waste. But you","words":[["of",122.7,122.96],["parts",122.96,123.44],["are",123.44,123.78],["counted",123.78,124.18],["as",124.18,124.38],["assets,",124.38,124.84],["but",125.26,125.58],["just",125.58,125.94],["in",125.94,126.2],["time",126.2,126.52],["sees",126.52,126.86],["them",126.86,127.08],["as",127.08,127.24],["unnecessary",127.24,127.9],["waste.",127.9,128.54],["But",129.0,129.4],["you",129.4,129.52]]},{"start":129.52,"end":135.56,"text":"never told us that JIT simply means waiting until the last moment to order new supplies","words":[["never",129.52,129.82],["told",129.82,130.08],["us",130.08,130.3],["that",130.3,130.46],["JIT",130.46,131.1],["simply",131.1,131.6],["means",131.6,132.0],["waiting",132.0,132.58],["until",132.58,132.96],["the",132.96,133.2],["last",133.2,133.62],["moment",133.62,134.12],["to",134.12,134.7],["order",134.7,134.96],["new",134.96,135.18],["supplies",135.18,135.56]]},{"start":135.56,"end":139.86,"text":"as you need them. Yes, you're right. I should have done that.","words":[["as",135.56,135.98],["you",135.98,136.14],["need",136.14,136.36],["them.",136.36,136.58],["Yes,",137.08,137.42],["you're",137.78,138.06],["right.",138.06,138.22],["I",138.8,139.04],["should",139.04,139.26],["have",139.26,139.4],["done",139.4,139.64],["that.",139.64,139.86]]},{"start":139.86,"end":147.0,"text":"Now, you talked a bit about standardizing parts as a way of streamlining JIT. Where did you","words":[["Now,",139.86,140.84],["you",140.98,141.16],["talked",141.16,141.48],["a",141.48,141.64],["bit",141.64,141.74],["about",141.74,142.08],["standardizing",142.08,143.14],["parts",143.14,143.58],["as",143.58,143.88],["a",143.88,143.98],["way",143.98,144.1],["of",144.1,144.2],["streamlining",144.2,144.9],["JIT.",144.9,145.54],["Where",146.16,146.72],["did",146.72,146.88],["you",146.88,147.0]]},{"start":147.0,"end":147.86,"text":"get your data from?","words":[["get",147.0,147.12],["your",147.12,147.24],["data",147.24,147.54],["from?",147.54,147.86]]},{"start":148.24,"end":153.52,"text":"Well, I tried an internet website on the subject which is called the Lean Clearinghouse, but","words":[["Well,",148.24,148.42],["I",148.62,148.9],["tried",148.9,149.14],["an",149.14,149.32],["internet",149.32,149.62],["website",149.62,150.18],["on",150.18,150.4],["the",150.4,150.52],["subject",150.52,150.82],["which",150.82,151.1],["is",151.1,151.22],["called",151.22,151.54],["the",151.54,151.86],["Lean",151.86,152.1],["Clearinghouse,",152.1,152.88],["but",153.26,153.52]]},{"start":153.52,"end":158.92,"text":"it was too technical for me. So in the end I got my data from a textbook called Learning","words":[["it",153.52,153.62],["was",153.62,153.76],["too",153.76,153.94],["technical",153.94,154.28],["for",154.28,154.6],["me.",154.6,154.78],["So",155.36,155.56],["in",155.56,155.82],["the",155.82,155.94],["end",155.94,156.16],["I",156.16,156.36],["got",156.36,156.52],["my",156.52,156.7],["data",156.7,157.02],["from",157.02,157.34],["a",157.34,157.56],["textbook",157.56,157.86],["called",157.86,158.46],["Learning",158.46,158.92]]},{"start":158.92,"end":164.12,"text":"from Toyota. I found some journal articles too, but they didn't seem very useful.","words":[["from",158.92,159.3],["Toyota.",159.3,159.68],["I",160.34,160.52],["found",160.52,160.76],["some",160.76,160.9],["journal",160.9,161.18],["articles",161.18,161.78],["too,",161.78,162.06],["but",162.6,162.76],["they",162.76,162.96],["didn't",162.96,163.16],["seem",163.16,163.46],["very",163.46,163.72],["useful.",163.72,164.12]]},{"start":164.12,"end":170.34,"text":"Yes. Well, there is a US government report on it, I've seen. I'll get a copy for you.","words":[["Yes.",164.12,165.1],["Well,",165.58,165.98],["there",166.04,166.26],["is",166.26,166.48],["a",166.48,166.6],["US",166.6,167.04],["government",167.04,167.46],["report",167.46,167.94],["on",167.94,168.22],["it,",168.22,168.34],["I've",168.4,168.52],["seen.",168.52,168.82],["I'll",169.34,169.56],["get",169.56,169.66],["a",169.66,169.76],["copy",169.76,169.92],["for",169.92,170.18],["you.",170.18,170.34]]},{"start":170.6,"end":173.1,"text":"Great. I look forward to reading through it.","words":[["Great.",170.6,170.9],["I",171.44,171.76],["look",171.76,171.92],["forward",171.92,172.18],["to",172.18,172.38],["reading",172.38,172.54],["through",172.54,172.86],["it.",172.86,173.1]]},{"start":173.74,"end":179.08,"text":"And while you're at it, you might want to find out about cases where JIT might not be suitable,","words":[["And",173.74,174.12],["while",174.12,174.3],["you're",174.3,174.48],["at",174.48,174.68],["it,",174.68,174.84],["you",175.0,175.12],["might",175.12,175.4],["want",175.4,175.6],["to",175.6,175.76],["find",175.76,175.98],["out",175.98,176.18],["about",176.18,176.44],["cases",176.44,176.88],["where",176.88,177.16],["JIT",177.16,177.76],["might",177.76,178.04],["not",178.04,178.42],["be",178.42,178.68],["suitable,",178.68,179.08]]},{"start":179.82,"end":183.78,"text":"and that's in service industries like tourism or healthcare,","words":[["and",179.82,180.24],["that's",180.24,180.78],["in",180.78,180.96],["service",180.96,181.4],["industries",181.4,181.9],["like",181.9,182.22],["tourism",182.22,182.72],["or",182.72,183.24],["healthcare,",183.24,183.78]]},{"start":184.24,"end":188.26,"text":"where customers are paying for something that they can't actually see or count.","words":[["where",184.24,184.52],["customers",184.52,184.84],["are",184.84,185.1],["paying",185.1,185.26],["for",185.26,185.46],["something",185.46,185.74],["that",185.74,186.0],["they",186.0,186.14],["can't",186.14,186.44],["actually",186.44,186.82],["see",186.82,187.32],["or",187.32,187.66],["count.",187.66,188.26]]},{"start":188.26,"end":194.0,"text":"although JIT is fashionable today some people would say it hasn't proved so","words":[["although",188.26,189.52],["JIT",189.52,190.14],["is",190.14,190.36],["fashionable",190.36,190.74],["today",190.74,191.22],["some",191.22,191.96],["people",191.96,192.22],["would",192.22,192.42],["say",192.42,192.66],["it",192.66,192.84],["hasn't",192.84,193.26],["proved",193.26,193.6],["so",193.6,194.0]]},{"start":194.0,"end":198.24,"text":"successful in the service sector as it has with the manufacturing of goods that","words":[["successful",194.0,194.58],["in",194.58,194.82],["the",194.82,194.94],["service",194.94,195.28],["sector",195.28,195.72],["as",195.72,196.1],["it",196.1,196.24],["has",196.24,196.5],["with",196.5,196.72],["the",196.72,196.84],["manufacturing",196.84,197.38],["of",197.38,197.72],["goods",197.72,198.02],["that",198.02,198.24]]},{"start":198.24,"end":202.46,"text":"can be quantified that would be interesting I'll see what I can find","words":[["can",198.24,198.38],["be",198.38,198.48],["quantified",198.48,199.18],["that",199.18,199.88],["would",199.88,200.18],["be",200.18,200.42],["interesting",200.42,200.9],["I'll",200.9,201.76],["see",201.76,201.88],["what",201.88,202.0],["I",202.0,202.12],["can",202.12,202.24],["find",202.24,202.46]]},{"start":202.46,"end":211.2,"text":"out before you hear the rest of the discussion you have some time to look","words":[["out",202.46,202.72],["before",202.72,2