ut",265.64,265.8],["with",265.8,265.94],["a",265.94,266.06],["little",266.06,266.22],["work,",266.22,266.62],["your",266.9,266.98],["next",266.98,267.38],["presentation",267.38,268.08],["should",268.08,268.38],["be",268.38,268.56],["excellent.",268.56,269.14]]},{"start":269.62,"end":275.12,"text":"Fine. That would be helpful. Actually, I wasn't happy with my delivery. I sometimes","words":[["Fine.",269.62,269.96],["That",270.44,270.66],["would",270.66,270.8],["be",270.8,270.94],["helpful.",270.94,271.24],["Actually,",271.86,272.34],["I",272.6,272.76],["wasn't",272.76,273.06],["happy",273.06,273.4],["with",273.4,273.6],["my",273.6,273.8],["delivery.",273.8,274.16],["I",274.58,274.76],["sometimes",274.76,275.12]]},{"start":275.12,"end":282.06,"text":"seemed to talk fast and sometimes slow I was on edge I guess. Yes you were and as","words":[["seemed",275.12,275.38],["to",275.38,275.8],["talk",275.8,276.04],["fast",276.04,276.58],["and",276.58,276.96],["sometimes",276.96,277.44],["slow",277.44,277.88],["I",277.88,278.66],["was",278.66,278.8],["on",278.8,278.98],["edge",278.98,279.22],["I",279.22,279.44],["guess.",279.44,279.66],["Yes",279.94,280.34],["you",280.34,280.68],["were",280.68,280.96],["and",280.96,281.9],["as",281.9,282.06]]},{"start":282.06,"end":287.78,"text":"well as that your purpose wasn't very specific. In future you need to lay out","words":[["well",282.06,282.22],["as",282.22,282.38],["that",282.38,282.64],["your",282.64,283.02],["purpose",283.02,283.72],["wasn't",283.72,284.2],["very",284.2,284.42],["specific.",284.42,285.04],["In",285.88,286.22],["future",286.22,286.58],["you",286.58,287.08],["need",287.08,287.26],["to",287.26,287.42],["lay",287.42,287.6],["out",287.6,287.78]]},{"start":287.78,"end":293.88,"text":"exactly what you're going to cover and why. Make it clear and concise and not so","words":[["exactly",287.78,288.32],["what",288.32,288.7],["you're",288.7,288.9],["going",288.9,289.02],["to",289.02,289.18],["cover",289.18,289.5],["and",289.5,290.16],["why.",290.16,290.6],["Make",291.16,291.54],["it",291.54,291.7],["clear",291.7,292.24],["and",292.24,292.46],["concise",292.46,292.94],["and",292.94,293.32],["not",293.32,293.72],["so",293.72,293.88]]},{"start":293.88,"end":299.7,"text":"general. And what about my transitions from one section to the next? Well you","words":[["general.",293.88,294.22],["And",294.78,295.3],["what",295.3,295.54],["about",295.54,295.76],["my",295.76,295.96],["transitions",295.96,296.48],["from",296.48,296.84],["one",296.84,297.12],["section",297.12,297.48],["to",297.48,297.8],["the",297.8,297.9],["next?",297.9,298.16],["Well",298.76,299.32],["you",299.32,299.7]]},{"start":299.7,"end":304.34,"text":"didn't link the sections did you? You went too quickly from one to the next.","words":[["didn't",299.7,299.98],["link",299.98,300.32],["the",300.32,300.56],["sections",300.56,300.96],["did",300.96,301.3],["you?",301.3,301.6],["You",302.02,302.34],["went",302.34,302.52],["too",302.52,302.82],["quickly",302.82,303.22],["from",303.22,303.52],["one",303.52,303.7],["to",303.7,303.86],["the",303.86,303.96],["next.",303.96,304.34]]},{"start":304.34,"end":306.18,"text":"It was all just too abrupt.","words":[["It",304.34,304.9],["was",304.9,305.16],["all",305.16,305.3],["just",305.3,305.58],["too",305.58,305.88],["abrupt.",305.88,306.18]]},{"start":306.7,"end":308.42,"text":"Okay. I'll try to improve that.","words":[["Okay.",306.7,306.96],["I'll",307.2,307.68],["try",307.68,307.82],["to",307.82,307.94],["improve",307.94,308.16],["that.",308.16,308.42]]},{"start":308.92,"end":311.42,"text":"Now, your PowerPoint visuals were lovely,","words":[["Now,",308.92,309.36],["your",309.48,309.7],["PowerPoint",309.7,310.32],["visuals",310.32,310.8],["were",310.8,311.02],["lovely,",311.02,311.42]]},{"start":311.72,"end":315.78,"text":"but sometimes I got the feeling that nice as they were as pictures,","words":[["but",311.72,312.2],["sometimes",312.2,313.1],["I",313.1,313.42],["got",313.42,313.58],["the",313.58,313.78],["feeling",313.78,314.12],["that",314.12,314.4],["nice",314.4,314.84],["as",314.84,315.0],["they",315.0,315.12],["were",315.12,315.26],["as",315.26,315.46],["pictures,",315.46,315.78]]},{"start":316.2,"end":319.66,"text":"they didn't have much to do with what you were talking about, right?","words":[["they",316.2,316.38],["didn't",316.38,316.68],["have",316.68,316.92],["much",316.92,317.24],["to",317.24,317.44],["do",317.44,317.62],["with",317.62,317.76],["what",317.76,317.9],["you",317.9,318.04],["were",318.04,318.14],["talking",318.14,318.48],["about,",318.48,318.92],["right?",318.92,319.66]]},{"start":320.46,"end":320.98,"text":"You're right.","words":[["You're",320.46,320.76],["right.",320.76,320.98]]},{"start":321.72,"end":325.12,"text":"And, you know, another thing I could see from the other students' reactions,","words":[["And,",321.72,321.98],["you",322.0,322.08],["know,",322.08,322.2],["another",322.26,322.5],["thing",322.5,322.84],["I",322.84,323.24],["could",323.24,323.38],["see",323.38,323.62],["from",323.62,323.82],["the",323.82,323.96],["other",323.96,324.16],["students'",324.16,324.58],["reactions,",324.76,325.12]]},{"start":325.42,"end":328.72,"text":"they just didn't understand some of the vocabulary I was using.","words":[["they",325.42,325.52],["just",325.52,325.7],["didn't",325.7,326.14],["understand",326.14,326.64],["some",326.64,326.98],["of",326.98,327.12],["the",327.12,327.2],["vocabulary",327.2,327.74],["I",327.74,328.3],["was",328.3,328.46],["using.",328.46,328.72]]},{"start":328.98,"end":330.02,"text":"Hmm. Good point.","words":[["Hmm.",328.98,329.26],["Good",329.42,329.62],["point.",329.62,330.02]]},{"start":330.9,"end":332.82,"text":"Well, remember, your audience were laymen,","words":[["Well,",330.9,331.12],["remember,",331.12,331.4],["your",331.6,331.66],["audience",331.66,332.04],["were",332.04,332.3],["laymen,",332.3,332.82]]},{"start":332.82,"end":339.0,"text":"mostly without knowledge of JIT, so you need to simplify and try to put things","words":[["mostly",332.82,333.58],["without",333.58,334.0],["knowledge",334.0,334.44],["of",334.44,334.58],["JIT,",334.58,335.08],["so",335.58,336.34],["you",336.34,336.64],["need",336.64,336.82],["to",336.82,337.02],["simplify",337.02,337.56],["and",337.56,338.02],["try",338.02,338.38],["to",338.38,338.54],["put",338.54,338.72],["things",338.72,339.0]]},{"start":339.0,"end":345.4,"text":"in everyday English. I never seem to do that. And lastly I'll just mention your","words":[["in",339.0,339.22],["everyday",339.22,339.64],["English.",339.64,340.2],["I",340.46,340.68],["never",340.68,341.02],["seem",341.02,341.28],["to",341.28,341.46],["do",341.46,341.64],["that.",341.64,341.92],["And",342.92,343.56],["lastly",343.56,344.46],["I'll",344.46,344.72],["just",344.72,344.88],["mention",344.88,345.2],["your",345.2,345.4]]},{"start":345.4,"end":351.42,"text":"body language. You didn't use gestures and you just stood straight without any","words":[["body",345.4,345.64],["language.",345.64,346.1],["You",346.84,347.4],["didn't",347.4,347.9],["use",347.9,348.12],["gestures",348.12,348.66],["and",348.66,349.3],["you",349.3,349.5],["just",349.5,349.76],["stood",349.76,349.94],["straight",349.94,350.54],["without",350.54,351.0],["any",351.0,351.42]]},{"start":351.42,"end":356.78,"text":"animation. It didn't make you seem very interested in the subject. I know even","words":[["animation.",351.42,351.98],["It",352.52,353.06],["didn't",353.06,353.38],["make",353.38,353.54],["you",353.54,353.7],["seem",353.7,353.88],["very",353.88,354.1],["interested",354.1,354.62],["in",354.62,354.86],["the",354.86,354.98],["subject.",354.98,355.38],["I",355.74,355.92],["know",355.92,356.16],["even",356.16,356.78]]},{"start":356.78,"end":358.76,"text":"Even though I really do like the subject.","words":[["Even",356.78,356.86],["though",356.86,357.0],["I",357.0,357.2],["really",357.2,357.56],["do",357.56,357.88],["like",357.88,358.24],["the",358.24,358.44],["subject.",358.44,358.76]]},{"start":359.28,"end":359.68,"text":"Sorry.","words":[["Sorry.",359.28,359.68]]},{"start":360.32,"end":365.78,"text":"Well, despite all this, I enjoyed your presentation and I could see you put lots of work into","words":[["Well,",360.32,360.88],["despite",361.1,361.44],["all",361.44,361.9],["this,",361.9,362.16],["I",362.32,362.44],["enjoyed",362.44,362.76],["your",362.76,362.98],["presentation",362.98,363.4],["and",363.4,364.02],["I",364.02,364.14],["could",364.14,364.26],["see",364.26,364.44],["you",364.44,364.56],["put",364.56,364.68],["lots",364.68,365.06],["of",365.06,365.24],["work",365.24,365.46],["into",365.46,365.78]]},{"start":365.78,"end":366.04,"text":"it.","words":[["it.",365.78,366.04]]},{"start":366.8,"end":369.86,"text":"I look forward to an even better presentation from you next time.","words":[["I",366.8,366.96],["look",366.96,367.08],["forward",367.08,367.34],["to",367.34,367.5],["an",367.5,367.62],["even",367.62,367.92],["better",367.92,368.32],["presentation",368.32,368.94],["from",368.94,369.18],["you",369.18,369.36],["next",369.36,369.54],["time.",369.54,369.86]]},{"start":370.2,"end":371.84,"text":"Well, thanks for your help.","words":[["Well,",370.2,370.38],["thanks",370.96,371.36],["for",371.36,371.54],["your",371.54,371.62],["help.",371.62,371.84]]},{"start":375.12,"end":376.98,"text":"That is the end of Part 3.","words":[["That",375.12,375.6],["is",375.6,375.78],["the",375.78,375.94],["end",375.94,376.18],["of",376.18,376.32],["Part",376.32,376.56],["3.",376.56,376.98]]},{"start":378.24,"end":382.54,"text":"You now have 30 seconds to check your answers to Part 3.","words":[["You",378.24,378.52],["now",378.52,378.76],["have",378.76,379.06],["30",379.06,379.54],["seconds",379.54,380.06],["to",380.06,380.56],["check",380.56,380.88],["your",380.88,381.18],["answers",381.18,381.62],["to",381.62,381.88],["Part",381.88,382.12],["3.",382.12,382.54]]}]}